cff-version: 1.2.0
title: 'TRL Assess'
message: 'If you use this software, please cite it as below.'
type: software
abstract: >-
  A two-tier Technology Readiness Level self-assessment web application. Tier 1 gives a quick,
  self-reported estimate; Tier 2 produces an evidence-backed assessment of Critical Technology
  Elements with Excel export and a hash-verified evidence package. It runs entirely in the browser
  and is not an independent Technology Readiness Assessment.
authors:
